---
const canonical = 'https://mira.maccrate.ai/privacy';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy notice for Mira Machine." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#09070d" />
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
  <title>Privacy — Mira Machine</title>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <nav><a href="/">← Back to Mira</a></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Mira Machine</p>
    <h1>Privacy notice.</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated July 18, 2026</p>
    <p>Mira is a public browser experiment. It has no user accounts, advertising, or analytics.</p>

    <h2>Data on your device</h2>
    <p>Mira stores investigation progress, discovered evidence, and cached responses in your browser using local storage. Restarting the investigation removes its saved game state. You can remove all locally stored data through your browser’s site-data controls.</p>

    <h2>Local AI</h2>
    <p>If you choose <strong>Wake local Mira</strong>, Gemma 4 runs through WebGPU in your browser. Your investigation is not sent to a hosted chat service.</p>

    <h2>Shared discoveries</h2>
    <p>For a genuinely new evidence pair, Mira may send the two evidence identifiers, the game version, and its short generated pair result to the shared discovery registry. The registry does not receive your full conversation, hypothesis, saved game, or a user account.</p>
    <p>The registry derives a rotating pseudonymous value from the network request for rate limiting and abuse prevention. Cloudflare and the hosting server necessarily process ordinary request information, including the IP address, while handling the request.</p>
    <p>The first valid result is retained so the same pair returns that exact result to every later player. Rate-limit and security records may remain for abuse prevention.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Mira does not use advertising or analytics cookies. Browser storage is used only for the game behavior described above.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Current public contact methods are listed on the <a href="https://maccrate.ai/about#contact">MacCrate.ai About page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

<style>
  :root{color-scheme:dark;--ink:#f8f0da;--muted:#b8af9d;--rule:rgba(248,240,218,.2);--green:#9cf0b4;--bg:#09070d}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 8%,rgba(93,75,122,.18),transparent 30%),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.65}
  main{width:min(720px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto;padding:48px 0 90px}
  nav{margin-bottom:70px}a{color:var(--green);text-underline-offset:4px}nav a{text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
  .eyebrow,.updated{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted)}
  h1{max-width:620px;margin:12px 0 22px;font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(58px,10vw,96px);font-weight:400;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .updated{margin-bottom:36px}
  h2{margin:58px 0 12px;padding-top:25px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,38px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.1}
  p{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:17px}
  strong{color:var(--green)}
  @media(max-width:520px){main{width:min(100% - 28px,720px);padding-top:28px}nav{margin-bottom:52px}p{font-size:16px}h2{margin-top:48px}}
</style>
